	Section:
		Text: Images
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Formats
		Paragraph: An `Image` reads PNG (also with transparency), JPEG and SVG files, and pages of a PDF. An SVG goes into the PDF as a vector drawing, sharp at any size. The engine accepts a closed subset of SVG: shapes, paths, groups, gradients, clipping paths, `use` and text.
